<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- TRADUCTION BILBE EN KINYANGA</book>
  <para style="h">Bakorosai</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bakorosai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Emaruba a Poro kuri eBakorosai</para>
  <para style="mt">Bakorosai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s">Nkei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Ani Poro, ntumwa ya Yesu Kirisitu murisasa ra Ongo. Ani na munakitu Timoteo, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />twabuandikire banu bana Ongo ba murubungu rwa ku Korosai, banu banakitu mbi musimira Yesu muriira. Nchumo na buhoro imbi bitukange kuri Ongo, bibesi hima ninu.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahemo itata Ongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Kira ntambi inji ibuhemenga bate tutatanga Ongo, Tita wa Nyere Kuritu Yesu Kirisitu. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Tukorange mbo bushwa mbu twamarukira emyasi y'erisimira rinu Yesu Kirisitu nambu bwashima banu ebea bati ba Ongo. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Erisimira rinu n'erishimana rinu ratukana n'emwinyihiro winu mbu mukuninkwa mukisa ingu wabubike Ongo mu mbingu. Mumakinda irukira bushwa n'emwinyihiro ngo entambi mubesenga mumakinda ihanwa ekinwa ch'eriira na nge Mwasi wakonda wa Ongo. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />eMwasi Wakonda ngo, ubutange byuma mbi byarisa mu chuo kiti imbu bwabesenga byo itukire erotu ndu rwarukiranga banu bebange bushwa n'enchumo ya Ongo n'isiba iteerera yo mbu iyo iira. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Epafura mukori munakitu ingu washima bate, iwe ng'wabuhananga emyasi njo. Iwe mukori w'iira wa Kirisitu bushwa nitu. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Iwe ng'watuturenga emyasi y'enchimi yinu eyaninkwanga banu n'eMutima Washurukara.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Bushwa nancho, tutangaruhwa ibuheme banu itukire erotu ndu rwarukiranga bate emyasi inu. Tubuhemengi Ongo wabusaki iteerera erisasa rae n'ibuninka butesa na bwenge ebwatuka kuri eMutima wae. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Nampo musekocha ibese imbu bwashima Nyere Kuritu, n'imukokomya mu binwa biti. Ietere mbyo, mǔkocha ikora mikorere yakonda ya kira bususe n'ienderee isiba Ongo. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Ongo wendi ubuninkange maa mu bukwakare bwae, imbu buri n'ebusime kongo mwandira mu kira kikai, na ntintímuruha. Ngebumbo, hima na ngoa, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />mwendi mutate Ongo Tita, ingu ewakubusakenga ibese bea imbi bakomenwa ishee muhango w'emwandu winu, ewabikengae ebea bae mu bwami bw'echaka. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Bushwa mbu iwe wamakindanga itushukaya ituka mu maa emwerimya, n'itukimisha mu bwami bwa Musike we ingu washima we. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Ietere we, twamashukara n'isasirwa esansambi situ.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirisitu uri hiyo n'ebiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kirisitu nge nsusanyi ya Ongo eutanga sungwa. Iwe nge ntangi y'ebiti mbi byabumbwa. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Ietere we, Ongo wábumba ebikai biti ebiri mu mbingu na mu chuo, ebisungwange n'ebitangasungwa, kuba bwami, bukwakare, isima abe isimanire. Ongo wabumbanga ebiti ietere we, na bushwa nae. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kirisitu wabesenga ho kubusondori n'ebikai biti, ietere we ebiti byendange shu hima. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Iwe nge muntwe w'ekanisa nki kabikirwa mbu, mubi wae. Iwe nge ntangiro na waroso murifuka munkati n'ebakwi, kongo wabese waroso mu biti. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Bushwa mbu Ongo wisine washimanga mbu eriira rae risungwe ietere Musike we. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Ietere Musike we washimanga ironganya echuo nae. Ietere echama ya Musike we inji yakubukanga mu musaraba, Ongo wamarisha buhoro, nampo waronganya ebikai biti nae, imbi biri mu chuo na mu mbingu.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Na banu kare-kare mubesenga kore na Ongo, mubesenga barenda bae, bushwa n'emyanikiri n'emikorere yinu yema. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ina ke, Ongo wamakinda iburonganya nae, ietere erikwa ra Musike we mu mubi, kongo wabusake isungwa mu makako ae nti mumashurukara, anga burema abe ikosa riti-riti. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ina mukomenwa isimira eMwasi Wakonda wa Ongo na ntimusimana na ntibanu muri na maa. Kiro musia emwinyihiro ngu waninkwanga banu murekia murukira eMwasi Wakonda wa Ongo. eMwasi wakonda ngo wamaturwa kuri ebea bati b'echuo hano, na ani Poro ngie mukori wae. <verse eid="COL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ngebumbo, namoere eminubo nji yetange mo ani bushwa ninu. Ietere erinuba rani mu mubi, n'iberereshange eminubo nji yasianga Kirisitu bushwa n'emubi wae, ngerieba mbu ekanisa. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Ani ngie mukori w'ekanisa itukana n'emurimo ngu wanininkanga Ongo bushwa ninu. Emurimo ngo nti itura eMwasi Wakonda muriira. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />eMwasi Wakonda ngo, nge wabisangae itukire kare-kare, ina ke wamashea o kuri ebea bae. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Bushwa mbu Ongo wasondanga ishea ebea mbo enama yanchi chabisa we ekiri n'ebutumba bukiri mbu ebwaronjanga we bushwa n'ebea bati. N'echabisae ncho ngerieba mbu Kirisitu uri kumunda ninu, nae nguturishiengi emwinyihiro mbu twabeseyo mu busime bwa Ongo. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Bushwa nancho tusheange Kirisitu kuri ebea bati. Tutondengi n'ihana kira mwea mu butesa buti kongo twasake ebea bati ihiere ibesa bea b'iira mu bunakima bwabo na Kirisitu. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Bushwa nancho, nikorange n'ikwisumya mu bukwakare buninkwange ani na Kirisitu imbu busingwange nakora na maa.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nisondange musibe imbu bukorange ani murimo na muho bushwa ninu, na bushwa nambi ebasimira Yesu ba ku Raondikia na kuri ebati mbi ebatanganisunganga. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Nisumyange kongo babese na muho na bunakima mu nchimi. Hiyo nambyo, babesi n'isimira riira ndi ritukanage n'eriteera r'eriira. Nampo basesiba echabiswa na Ongo, ngerieba mbu isiba Kirisitu wisine. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Bushwa mbu ebutumba buti bw'ebutesa n'ebwenge bwabiswa kumunda nae. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Nibwirengi banu ebinwa bino, kongo kutabi mwea ingu wabuhusa mu binwa byashamuka b'iriminya. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Nakiro mbu nirikore ninu mu mubi, ina n'irihima ninu mu mutima. Nani namoa tu murisunga mbu buri banu murisimana shu n'iandira munkati n'erisimira mu makako a Kirisitu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirisitu wisine ng'uninkananga ekaramo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Bushwa mbu mumakinda isimira Kirisitu ibese Nyere Kurinu, murike mu bunakima hima nae. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Mwandire kumunda nae, mwitingiri mu binwa mbi byakuhanwa banu bushwa nae n'iandira murisimira itukana nambu bwahanwanga banu. Hiyo n'ebiti mbyo, mwendi mubesa bea bitata Ongo kiratambi. <verse eid="COL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mukohyanga, kutabi mwea waburiminya itukana na bwenge bwae bw'ebukongobanya bwa busa-busa, imbu bwinyihire ntungo sa bea na mutima wema ngu warisa echuo. Ina ntíwirae mu mahano a Kirisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Bushwa mbu eriira riti ra Ongo riri kumunda na Kirisitu ietere emubi wae. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Namuribese banu hima nae mu bunakima, ngie banu bea b'iira. Iwe ngie wasimanire emitima iti eiri n'ebukwakare. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Muribese mu bunakima hima nae, namakinda imoneshwa na kirisitu. N'erimoneshwa ndo, ramabushukaya ituka mu butetera bw'emubi. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Mumakinda ikwa hima na Kirisitu ietere ense yerirubukwa. Na banu mumafuka hotu hima nae, bushwa mbu mumasimira ebukwakare bwa Ongo ingu wamufuranga. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Kare-kare mubesenga mumakwa bushwa n'esansambi sinu na bushwa mubesenga ntímumoneshwa. Ina ke, Ongo wamabuninka banu karamo hima na Kirisitu, nae wamakinda itusasira esansambi siti. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Wakusisibanya emaruba eminda yitu nambi ebyasingwanga batusongere. Wakusisibanya byo mwikongomee byo mu musaraba. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Ongo wakunyaka ebukwakare bw'ebakwakare na mbi basimanire ebea, nae washea bo shu-shu na ntwenjange bo buri bea mbi baminwa mu mukonga w'erihima ra Musike wae. <verse eid="COL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Bushwa nancho, kiro kwabese mwea uti-uti ngu wasebuhukumu bushwa nambi byarisa banu, abe ebyomo banu, abe bushwa r'erimisa kibimbi kirebe, abe kibimbi ch'erisaa r'emweri, abe otu rw'eSabato. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ebinwa biti mbyo, kirimirimi byambi biseya. Ina eriira r'ebinwa biti mbi nti Kirisitu ho wisine. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Anga murisia ihukumiwa na mwea uti-uti ingu wisheange mbu iwe murongu n'usimanikengi ebamaraika. Emwea ewasusa mbo wiseke nguru mu binwa mbi byasunga we buri nsori, na ntwitatengi busa bushwa r'emyanikiri yae y'emubi. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Ebea mbo bamikuto kuri Kirisitu ingu wasimanire ekanisa, iwe nge muntwe w'emubi wae. Kirisitu nge urishange n'ikumanyanya ebitambo n'emisi iti. Ngebumbo, emubi wae uti watunganana imbu bwashima Ongo.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Banu mumakinda ikwa hima na Kirisitu n'ishukara ituka mu bukwakare bw'emutima wema ingu wasimanire echuo. Mbeni bushwanki banu mubesengi tu buri bea b'echuo mbi bamimwange imisa myenjo buri ino: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />«Anga murisa kino», «anga irora kino», «anga iturana mu kino na kino!» <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ebinwa biti bino byashea bikai bibihabiha rima ho murikoreshiwa. N'ebiti mbyo mwenjo na mahano ebea ho. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Muriira, emenjo ino isungwanga buri ya butesa, bushwa mbu yatukana n'emahano erisimanike yakwisine y'ebea mbo hima n'eburongu bwabo nerikwimima rabo r'erinubya emubi. Ina itangasake kikai murihangire ekarawa k'emubi.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Bushwa mbu ke mumafuka hima na Kirisitu, mwenda musonda ebikai bya mu mbingu, inku kwarika Kirisitu muruharo rwa kwabume kwa Ongo. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Mwendi mwanikira nguru ebinwa mbi ebiri kokwiyo, ina angi mwenda mwanikira ebinwa by'echuo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Bushwa mbu mumakinda ikwa, n'ekaramo kinu kabiswa hima na Kirisitu kuri Ongo. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Kirisitu nge karamo kinu k'eriira. Nawasekiya wasungwa tu, na banu mukusungwa hima nae mu busime bwae.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebuingo bwakare-kare n'ebushasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Ngebumbo, mureki ebinwa biti by'echuo ebiri kumunda ninu: Busingirani, mikorere yema, myanikiri yabusingirani, karawa na karawa ka behe inki kari buri isimanike kamoi. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ebikai buri mbyo bisingwanga Ongo wasubuke ebatina imurukira. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Bumbo nge wabesenga bwitingengi banu ematu ngi abesenga akiri mu banu mu sansambi. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ina ke, mutae kore ebikai biti bino: busubuke, bushu, manko, ihambike, na angi mwenda mweba kinwa kiti-kiti chema. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Angi ienda mwebane manko munkati ninu, bushwa mbu mumakinda ireke emikorere yinu ya kare-kare. <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Ngie banu mumakinda ibinduka ibese bea bashasha. Na Ongo ngubukiange mubesi bashasha kirotu, kongo mususana nae, na mumuteerere shu-shu. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />eBayuta, n'entí Bayuta, ebamona, n'entíbamona, ebeni, bashensi, etuhungu, n'entítuhungu: Ebati barengeke. Ina Kirisitu wisine ho ng'waraisha, nae uri mu biti. <verse eid="COL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Banu bea ba Ongo, iwe wamabushima n'iburondora bushwa nae kisine. Bushwa nancho, mubesi na mutima wa bonso, bongo, kwihohea na muandire. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Kuba mwea uri na kinwa chisongere munachabo, mwendi mu sasirana, imbu bwakianga Kirisitu wabusasira. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Echaraisha mu biti bino, mwendi mubese na nchimi bushwa mbu enchimi ironganyanga ebiti mu bunakima bweriira. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Ebuhoro bwa Kirisitu burise mu mitima inu. Bushwa mbu ietere bo murebikirwa banu bati ibese mwea uma. Mwendi musubukia ebyakonda ebyakubukore bo. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />eMyasi ya Kirisitu irike mu bwingi kumunda ninu. Mwendi mu hanana n'ininkana mahano mu butesa, mwendi mweba akisanti kwa Ongo mu mitima inu n'imutata mu Saburi na ndumbo insi sarisa eMutima Washurukara. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kira kikai nchi kironjange banu abe ieba, muronje byo murina ra Nyere Kuritu Yesu, mwitata Ongo Tita ietere Kirisitu.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahano bushwa n'ebuingo bushasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Banu ebomina, mwendi musubaha bake binu imbu bwakomenwa ibese mu makako a Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Banu ebabume, mwendi mushima bakari binu, angi mwendi musuwe bo. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Banu ebana, mwendi muronja ebweba ebabuti binu mu kira kinwa, bushwa mbu ekinwa kino chamoesha Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Banu ba tita, angi mwendi mushosha ebana binu, kongo bataneki emitima. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Banu etuhungu, mwendi muronja ebweba ba nyere kurinu mu kira kinwa hano hansi. Angi ienda muronja ebweba bo ho kuba banu muri hima nabo, mwisonda kwishea kuri bo. Ina muronje muriira ebweba bo, bushwa mbu musubaha Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Na kira kinwa nchi kironjange banu, muronje cho mu mutima wakonda, buri bea mbi bakorengi Nyere Kuritu, ina batangakore bea. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Musibanga mbu Nyere Kuritu, wasebuninka bihembo imbi byabike we ebea bae. Bushwa mbu Kirisitu nge Nyere Kuritu w'eriira eukorengi banu. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Ina ingu ukorange bibí, usehembwa itukana n'ebibi byarekora we, bushwa mbu Ongo wasehukumuyo kira mwea ingu ukorange bibí.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Na banu muri n'etuhungu, mwendi muninka to ebyakomenwa n'ebyeriira, na musibiriranga hotu mbu na banu mukorengi Kirisitu euri mu mbingu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Mwandire mu muhemo. Na mu mahemo ngo, mukohyanga. Mwenda banu mwerengi Ongo mbu mushima. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Mutuhemi na bate hotu, kongo Ongo watwobori esandubi s'erienda katura eMwasi wae w'ekaramo, ingu wabiswanga bushwa na Kirisitu. Na bushwa n'eMwasi ngo ngyasingwa naminwa. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Kai munihemi kongo naturao shu-shu imbu ebwakomenwa ani ikora. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Mwendi mubese na mikorere ya butesa kuri ebea imbi enti bakirisitu. Mukoreshe ishu esantambi esashee banu. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Ebinwa binu byakomenwa ibese binwa byakonda ematu ati na byaraisha. Mukomenwa isiba isako kira mwea ishu.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkei ya hende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tikiko munakitu, ingu washima bate, mukori winyihirwa, tuna munakitu ngu ukorange nani emurimo wa Nyere Kuritu, wasebuture emyasi yani eiti. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Kincho ngi chasingwa namutuma kuri banu kongo wabuture emyasi itu n'ibuninka muho. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Namutuma na munakitu Onesimu ingu washima ani na winyihirwa. Onesimu ngo mwea wakukwinu. Ibo ngi basebuture ebinwa biti ebyakweta kuno. <verse eid="COL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Arisitariko ngu waminwa hima nani wabukea. Na Mariko, munachabo Baranaba nae wabukea hotu. Mumakinda ihanwa bushwa na Mariko. Kuti weya kukwinu, mumukokenga ishu. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Na Yesu ingu wabikirwa mbu Yusito, nae wabukea hotu. Mubayuta bati mbi bakusimira, ebashatu bano ho ngi bakorange hima nani bushwa n'emurimo we bwami bwa Ongo. Bamanininka muho nguru. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Munakinu Epafura nae wabukea hotu. Iwe mukori wa Yesu Kirisitu, watangaruha muri buheme, kongo mwandira mu kinwa cha Ongo ni bereresha ebyashima Ongo. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ani kisine nakwisungire mu meso ani ebwinubyange we bushwa ninu na bushwa na banakitu imbi basimira Yesu ba ku Raondikia na ba ku Hierapori. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Munakitu ngu washima bate, munganga Ruka, na Ndema babukea. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mutukereanga banakitu ba ku Raondikia, hima na Nimufa, n'ebasimira Yesu imbi ebakumananenga mu mwae. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Mumakinda isoma emaruba ano mwesumyanga asomwe hotu mu kanisa ka ku Raondikia. Nabanu hotu musomanga emaruba ngi akianga nandikire ekanisa nko. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Mwerenga Arikipo mbu wakohyanga, waberereshe emurimo ngu waninkwangae na Nyere Kuritu. <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Ani Poro nabukea, musibanga mbu nikiri mu muyororo. Ongo wabukasani.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>